    {
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are a professional cold email writer for an AI Automation Agency.\n\nRecipient Information:\n\nCompany Name: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json['Company Name'] }}\nBusiness Type: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.Category }}\nEmail Tone: {{ $('On form submission').item.json['Email Style'] }}\n\nWebsite Weak Points:\n{{ $json.output['Weak Points'] }}\n\nWebsite Improvement Suggestions:\n{{ $json.output['Suggestions'] }}\n\nInstructions:\n\n1. Start the email with a greeting.\n\nExample:\nHi {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json['Company Name'] }} Team,\n\n2. Mention that while reviewing their website/business we noticed a few improvement opportunities.\n\n3. Naturally mention 1–2 weak points found on their website (for example SEO issues, missing call-to-action, slow website performance, poor lead capture, outdated design etc).\n\n4. After mentioning the weak points, briefly introduce the improvement suggestions that could help solve these issues.\n\n5. Mention the improvement suggestions naturally in the email (use the suggestions provided in the input).\n\n6. Explain that we specialize in helping businesses improve their digital presence and operations using modern technology, AI automation, and optimized websites.\n\n7. Briefly introduce our core services that can help improve their business:\n\n• Professional Website Development to create fast, modern, and conversion-focused websites\n• SEO Optimization to improve Google ranking and attract more organic traffic\n• AI Automation Systems to automate repetitive business tasks\n• AI Receptionist to answer customer inquiries 24/7\n• AI-Powered Lead Generation systems to capture more potential customers\n• Workflow Automation to streamline internal operations\n• Custom AI Agents designed specifically for business needs\n\n8. Explain briefly that these improvements help businesses:\n\n• increase online visibility\n• attract more customers\n• reduce operational costs\n• save valuable time\n• automate repetitive work\n• improve overall business efficiency\n\n9. Keep the email concise, natural, and professional.\n\n10. End the email with a soft call to action such as:\n\n\"If you'd like to learn more or explore additional improvements, feel free to contact us. We'd be happy to share a few AI automation and website improvement ideas tailored for your business.\"\n\nReturn the result in this format:\n\nMail Subject:\n{{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json['Company Name'] }} – AI quick idea\n\nMail Body:\n\nSignature:\n\nMuhammad Daoud\nAI Automation Engineer\nEmail: muhammaddaoudqadir@gmail.com\nPhone: +92 332 2522329\n",
        "attributes": {
          "attributes": [
            {
              "name": "Mail Subject",
              "description": "Eye catchy mail Subject for the cold mail",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "Mail Body",
              "description": "=body message of the mail, a perfect and clear cold mail.",
              "required": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
