    {
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are a professional website auditor and AI business automation consultant.\n\nAnalyze the following website in depth.\n\nWebsite URL:\n{{ $json.Website }}\n\nPerform a detailed audit and identify weaknesses.\n\nAnalyze the website from these perspectives:\n\n1. SEO Issues\n- Missing meta titles or descriptions\n- Poor keyword optimization\n- Weak content structure\n- Missing schema markup\n- Poor internal linking\n- Slow indexing or crawl issues\n\n2. UX / Design Problems\n- Poor navigation\n- Confusing layout\n- Slow loading pages\n- Mobile responsiveness issues\n- Weak call-to-action\n- Poor user journey\n\n3. Missing Business Elements\nCheck if the website is missing important business pages such as:\n- Testimonials or case studies\n- Clear services pages\n- Pricing page\n- Lead capture forms\n- Contact options\n- Trust signals (reviews, certifications)\n\n4. Technical Issues\n- Slow page speed\n- Core Web Vitals problems\n- Broken links\n- Missing alt text\n- Poor accessibility\n- Security or performance issues\n\n5. Market & Competitor Comparison\nAnalyze how this website might perform compared to modern competitors in the same industry.\n\nMention where the website looks outdated or less competitive.\n\n6. AI & Modern Website Trends\nEvaluate if the website is missing modern features such as:\n\n- AI chatbot or AI receptionist\n- AI lead capture system\n- Automated customer support\n- Smart personalization\n- AI-driven marketing automation\n- Conversion optimization tools\n\n7. Improvement Suggestions\nBased on the weaknesses found, suggest improvements that could help the business grow.\n\nFocus especially on:\n\n- AI automation opportunities\n- Conversion optimization\n- Better lead generation\n- Website modernization\n- SEO growth opportunities\n\nReturn the result in this format:\n\nWeak Points:\n• short bullet points explaining the problems\n\nSuggestions:\n• bullet points explaining how the website can be improved\n• include AI automation opportunities where relevant",
        "attributes": {
          "attributes": [
            {
              "name": "Weak Points",
              "description": "List of problems found on the website",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "Suggestions",
              "description": "Suggestions to improve the website",
              "required": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
